# A collapsed block counts only open tasks, and shows a bare ▸ when it hides only notes and done tasks.
file <<END
Groceries:
	- Milk
	- Eggs @done(2026-10-01)
	Remember the coupons
	- Bread
Archive:
	- Old task @done(2026-09-01)
	Some note
END
keys _
see Groceries: ▸ 2
see Archive: ▸
hide Archive: ▸ 1
quit
